      "name": "DEC-378 — board-approved +4/−4: add Idol of Oblivion, Bennie Bracks, Sevinne's Reclamation, Moonshaker Cavalry; cut Exalted Sunborn, Carrot Cake, Second Harvest, 1 Plains (38→37 lands). Blasphemous Act third wipe proposed and rejected by board (board-heavy deck) — removal-board 2/3 is an accepted deviation."
